<title>USA: Greenspan completes Congressional testimony.</title>
<headline>Greenspan completes Congressional testimony.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan completed his Congressional testimony on Thursday before the Joint Economic Committee.</p>
<p>During his testimony, the central bank chief seemed to lay the groundwork for a possible interest rates increase next week.</p>
</text>
